hypa-ttfx is a port of ttfx, which is a port of TerminalTextEffects (TTE).

    TerminalTextEffects
    https://github.com/ChrisBuilds/terminaltexteffects
    MIT License, Copyright (c) 2023 ChrisBuilds

    ttfx (Rust parity port)
    https://github.com/omacom-io/ttfx
    MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 37signals / omacom-io

Every effect in this program, the animation engine's architecture, and the
command-line interface are ChrisBuilds' design. ttfx translated that work to
Rust and reproduces its rendering exactly — frame for frame, byte for byte.
This project translates ttfx to C# / .NET Native-AOT and adds nothing of its
own to the art.

The parity test suite compares against ttfx at the commit pinned in
REFERENCE.md. That binary is built on demand via tools/parity/fetch_reference.sh;
it is not vendored here.

If you enjoy these effects, the credit belongs upstream.
